{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"patton-oswalt","name":"Patton Oswalt","birthDate":"1969-01-27","birthPlace":"Portsmouth, Virginia, USA","bio":"Patton Peter Oswalt (born January 27, 1969) is an American stand-up comedian, writer, and actor. Oswalt first began performing standup comedy in the late 1980s. After spending two seasons writing for MADtv and starring in his own 1996 comedy special for HBO, he began performing in films and television shows including his film debut Down Periscope (1996) and The King of Queens (1998 - 2007). A rare starring film role was the voice of Remy in Pixar's Ratatouille (2007). Oswalt has appeared in dozens of other films and television series, primarily comedies, including many voice roles.\n\nOswalt was married to writer Michelle Eileen McNamara on September 24, 2005 until her death in 2016. Their daughter, Alice Rigney Oswalt, was born on April 15, 2009. He has been married to actress Meredith Salenger since 2017.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-19T17:51:22+00:00","tmdbId":10872,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/10872","credits":[{"id":"eternals","title":"Eternals","character":"Pip the Troll (voice)"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/patton-oswalt.webp","filmography":[{"name":"The Dink","year":2026,"character":"Skip 'Piggy' Pigliani","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8dq7vaUkXPqwqKxBFW4qJNBWeop.jpg"},{"name":"GOAT","year":2026,"character":"Dennis Cooper (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wfuqMlaExcoYiUEvKfVpUTt1v4u.jpg"},{"name":"Buddy","year":2026,"character":"Strappy (voice)","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/1BdZbNvl1SfrrX8J9X5tQzN6Ivu.jpg"},{"name":"Goodbye, Monster","year":2026,"character":"Dad","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/x1B8kfCCm8K6dy1Iw51XPEhvPY5.jpg"},{"name":"In a Holidaze","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fLgaNOlDG4pduslae